    "body": "Adresses Coverity CIDs 1668069, 1668068, 1668067, 1668066 by properly locking for virtual clock access and snapshot synchronization. Also, made the scenario mutex recursive to avoid deadlocks during logging.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2959)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
